0 Wide, shallow groove in upper surface of thallus ; thallus edges curved down ; no clear margin along sides of thallus (hand lens) 014262826320Riccia glauca0
0 Thallus < 2 mm wide (check in case of branches of Pellia endiviifolia)01522292733016
0 Thallus 3 mm wide or more01522302734019
0 Midrib strongly differentiated from much thinner margins of thallus ; growing on trees or rocks01629312835017
