0 Colonies composed of red/purple, cylindrical worm-like shoots 038607550790Pleurozia purpurea0
0 Shoots not cylindrical and worm-like ; usually tightly pressed to a substrate03860765080039
0 Shoots forming black patches, tipped yellowish-green, on limestone or lime-rich rock 039767751810Marchesinia mackaii0
