0 All leaves with 2 sharp lobes 046899258960Lophocolea bidentata0
0 Individual leaves scarcely visible with the naked eye ; like tiny hands, with 3 or 4 symmetrical lobes (x20 hand lens)04790935997048
0 Individual leaves easily visible with the naked eye, or if not so then with 2 symmetrical lobes04790945998050
0 Leaves with 3 or 4 'fingers' shorter than the 'palm' ; branching pinnate 048939560990Lepidozia reptans0
